  "summary": "Wire the P-Link/S-Link U1U2 bus to AC-Port A (A1 U1, A2 U2), pick BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP in Intesis MAPS, configure the units, send the project, then map each indoor unit's _C commands and _S status objects from its block.",
