  "remote_sensors": "AO 103 Bacnet ambient temperature takes a room temperature from the BMS; BI/BO 101 Wired Remote Controller select body sensor or remote-controller sensor.",
  "setup": [
   "BACnet IP: DHCP for 30 seconds at first start-up, then the default IP 192.168.100.246.",
   "BACnet MS/TP uses the gateway's EIA-485 port.",
   "Set up the units and the protocol in Intesis MAPS and send the project to the gateway."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "Gateway-wide objects (BO 0, MO 0-2, AO 0) act on all units at once.",
   "The occupancy AV/BV objects at instances 0-3 drive built-in occupancy logic together with each unit's Occupancy_C."
  ]
